{"seq":1,"slug":"modulation","title":"大学通信工程 — 调制技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/communication-principles/modulation","wordCount":2074,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学通信工程-调制技术\">大学通信工程 — 调制技术</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>调制是通信工程中最具魔力的一步：它把你想传输的信息（人声、数据，统称基带信号）&quot;骑&quot;到一个高频载波上，让信息能够通过天线辐射出去、远距离传播。为什么需要调制？因为人声只有几千赫兹，对应的电磁波波长长达几十公里，需要几十公里长的天线才能有效辐射——这显然不现实。把信息搬到几亿赫兹的高频载波上，天线尺寸就缩小到了厘米级。调制，本质上是用信息去改变载波的某个参数。</p>\n<p>正弦载波 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A\\cos(2\\pi f_c t + \\varphi)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 有三个可改变的参数：振幅 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、频率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、相位 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span>。改变哪个，就得到哪种调制：改振幅是调幅（AM/ASK），改频率是调频（FM/FSK），改相位是调相（PM/PSK）。数字时代还把振幅和相位结合起来，发明了高效的 QAM。理解这三个&quot;旋钮&quot;，你就理解了从老式收音机到 5G 的全部调制原理。</p>\n<p>本课时先讲模拟调制（AM、FM）建立直觉，再深入数字调制（ASK、FSK、PSK、QAM），并引入衡量调制效率的关键概念——星座图与频谱效率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"模拟调制-am-与-fm\">模拟调制：AM 与 FM</h3><p><strong>调幅（AM, Amplitude Modulation）</strong> 用基带信号去改变载波的振幅。已调信号为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s(t) = [A + m(t)]\\cos(2\\pi f_c t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">cos</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">π</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是信息（如音乐）。载波振幅随音乐起伏，包络的形状就是信息本身。AM 的优点是接收机极其简单（一个二极管检波即可），这是早期收音机普及的关键。缺点是抗噪声能力差——噪声主要影响振幅，所以 AM 广播在雷雨天会有&quot;沙沙&quot;杂音。中波 AM 广播至今仍在使用，频段为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>530</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">530</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">530</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1700</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1700</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1700</span></span></span></span></span> kHz。</p>\n<p><strong>调频（FM, Frequency Modulation）</strong> 用基带信号去改变载波的瞬时频率。音乐声音大，载波频率偏移就大。FM 的革命性在于：噪声主要污染振幅而非频率，所以接收时只要把振幅&quot;削平&quot;，噪声就被大幅消除。这让 FM 广播（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">88</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>108</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">108</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">108</span></span></span></span></span> MHz）拥有了远胜 AM 的音质，能传输立体声音乐。代价是 FM 占用更宽的带宽——这又是一次&quot;用带宽换质量&quot;的经典工程权衡。1933 年阿姆斯特朗发明 FM，却长期受到既得利益者打压，这段技术史本身就是一部悲壮的传奇。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数字调制-让-0-和-1-搭乘载波\">数字调制：让 0 和 1 搭乘载波</h3><p>数字通信传输的是离散的比特。最基础的三种数字调制分别对应改变载波的三个参数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调制方式</th>\n<th>改变的参数</th>\n<th>&quot;0&quot; 和 &quot;1&quot; 的表示</th>\n<th>抗噪声</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ASK（幅移键控）</td>\n<td>振幅</td>\n<td>有载波 vs 无载波</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FSK（频移键控）</td>\n<td>频率</td>\n<td>高频 vs 低频</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PSK（相移键控）</td>\n<td>相位</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0°</span></span></span></span></span> 相位 vs <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span></span></span></span></span> 相位</td>\n<td>强</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>BPSK（二进制相移键控）</strong> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0°</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">180°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span></span></span></span></span> 两个相位表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，抗噪声能力强，是卫星和深空通信的常客。<strong>QPSK（四相相移键控）</strong> 用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mtext>、</mtext><mn>270</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0°、90°、180°、270°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0°</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">270°</span></span></span></span></span> 四个相位，一个符号携带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 比特，效率翻倍。</p>\n<h3 id=\"星座图-调制的-地图\">星座图：调制的&quot;地图&quot;</h3><p>理解数字调制最好的工具是<strong>星座图</strong>——在一个二维平面上（横轴 I 代表同相分量，纵轴 Q 代表正交分量），每个调制符号对应一个点。点的位置由振幅（到原点距离）和相位（角度）共同决定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;I/Q 平面&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;BPSK: 2点 → 1 bit/符号&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;QPSK: 4点 → 2 bit/符号&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;16-QAM: 16点 → 4 bit/符号&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;256-QAM: 256点 → 8 bit/符号&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"I/Q 平面\"] --&gt; B[\"BPSK: 2点 → 1 bit/符号\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"QPSK: 4点 → 2 bit/符号\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"16-QAM: 16点 → 4 bit/符号\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"256-QAM: 256点 → 8 bit/符号\"]</pre><p><strong>QAM（正交幅度调制）</strong> 同时调制振幅和相位，在星座图上排布出方阵状的点。点越多，每个符号携带的比特越多，频谱效率越高：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调制</th>\n<th>星座点数</th>\n<th>每符号比特</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>QPSK</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>卫星、信号弱时的 LTE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16-QAM</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Wi-Fi、中等信号 LTE</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64-QAM</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>良好信号下的 4G/Wi-Fi</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>256-QAM</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>5G、强信号近距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1024-QAM</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1024</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1024</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1024</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Wi-Fi 6、极佳信号</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这里藏着通信工程最重要的权衡之一：<strong>星座点越密，每符号传的比特越多（速率高），但点之间挨得越近，噪声稍大就会判错（抗噪声差）</strong>。这就是为什么你的手机信号好时用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>-QAM 跑高速，信号差时自动降到 QPSK 保稳定——这种&quot;自适应调制&quot;正是 4G/5G 高效的秘密。</p>\n<h3 id=\"频谱效率-每赫兹能传多少比特\">频谱效率：每赫兹能传多少比特</h3><p>衡量调制好坏的核心指标是<strong>频谱效率</strong>，单位是 比特/秒/赫兹（bit/s/Hz）。例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>-QAM 理论上每个符号传 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 比特，若每秒发 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 百万个符号、占用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> MHz 带宽，频谱效率就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> bit/s/Hz。在频谱资源极其昂贵的今天，提高频谱效率是通信技术进步的核心驱动力。从 2G 的 GMSK（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> bit/s/Hz）到 5G 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>-QAM 配合 MIMO（可达数十 bit/s/Hz），三十年间频谱效率提升了几十倍，这正是移动通信速率飞跃的根源。</p>\n<h3 id=\"真实场景-你的手机信号格如何决定网速\">真实场景：你的手机信号格如何决定网速</h3><p>当你从窗边走向地下室，手机信号格逐渐减少，这背后发生着实时的调制切换。信号好时，信噪比高，基站给你分配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>-QAM，每符号塞进 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span></span></span> 比特，网速飞快；走进电梯，信噪比骤降，星座点挤在一起容易判错，系统立刻降级到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span></span>-QAM 甚至 QPSK，速率下降但连接不断。这种毫秒级的自适应调制与编码（AMC），就是现代手机&quot;信号差时变慢但不掉线&quot;的工程实现。下次你看到网速波动，就能想到背后正在切换的星座图。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为什么人声（几千赫兹）不能直接通过天线辐射出去，而必须先调制到高频载波上？请用&quot;天线尺寸与波长成正比&quot;的原理解释。</li>\n<li>AM 和 FM 哪个抗噪声能力更强？为什么雷雨天 AM 广播杂音明显，而 FM 几乎不受影响？</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>-QAM 比 QPSK 频谱效率高得多，为什么手机信号差时反而要切换回 QPSK？请从星座图点间距的角度分析。</li>\n<li>一个系统每秒发送 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span></span></span></span></span> 万个符号，采用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span></span>-QAM，占用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> MHz 带宽。请计算它的比特率和频谱效率。</li>\n<li>画出 QPSK 的星座图（4 个点的大致位置），并标出每个点对应的 2 比特组合。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解 FM 发明者阿姆斯特朗的故事——一位天才发明家如何因技术理想与商业巨头抗争，是通信史上最动人也最悲怆的篇章。</li>\n<li>用 GNU Radio（开源软件无线电平台）实际生成并接收 BPSK/QAM 信号，在屏幕上看到真实的星座图，是理解调制最直观的方式。</li>\n<li>研究 Wi-Fi 标准的演进（802.11a/n/ac/ax），看每一代如何通过引入更高阶 QAM 和更多空间流提升速率。</li>\n<li>探索软件定义无线电（SDR）——一根几十元的 RTL-SDR 接收棒就能让你用电脑解调 FM 广播、ADS-B 飞机信号，把课本理论变成动手实验。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>调制是把信息搬上高频载波、实现远距离传输的关键技术，其本质是用信息去改变载波的振幅、频率或相位三个参数之一或组合。模拟调制中，AM 简单但怕噪声，FM 用带宽换来了优异音质。数字调制中，ASK/FSK/PSK 分别对应三个参数，而 QAM 同时调制振幅和相位，用星座图直观表达。星座点越密，频谱效率越高但抗噪声越差，这一权衡催生了自适应调制——现代手机信号好用高阶 QAM、信号差降回 QPSK 的智能机制。下一课时我们学习信源编码与信道编码，看信息如何被压缩和保护。建议复习：三个载波参数与调制类型的对应，以及星座密度与速率/可靠性的权衡。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学通信工程 — 调制技术","id":"大学通信工程-调制技术"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"模拟调制：AM 与 FM","id":"模拟调制-am-与-fm"},{"level":3,"text":"数字调制：让 0 和 1 搭乘载波","id":"数字调制-让-0-和-1-搭乘载波"},{"level":3,"text":"星座图：调制的\"地图\"","id":"星座图-调制的-地图"},{"level":3,"text":"频谱效率：每赫兹能传多少比特","id":"频谱效率-每赫兹能传多少比特"},{"level":3,"text":"真实场景：你的手机信号格如何决定网速","id":"真实场景-你的手机信号格如何决定网速"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学通信工程 — 采样定理与滤波器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/signals-and-systems/sampling-and-filtering"},"next":{"title":"大学通信工程 — 信源编码与信道编码","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/communication-principles/coding"}}